@startuml
title Edit Building & Log

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Core DB" as DB
database "Audit Log" as Audit

Editor -> UI : Submit building update
UI -> API : PUT /buildings/{id}
API -> DB : Update record
API -> Audit : Log change
Audit --> API : OK
API --> UI : 200 OK
UI --> Editor : Update confirmed
@enduml
